OL,3,GNEWSAReform's #72m donations 'entirely
OL,4,Ain line with law', Jenrick says
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobert Jenrick has said Reform UK
OL,7,Fbelieves #72m of donations it has
OL,8,Freceived from two cryptocurrency
OL,9,Fbillionaires are "entirely in line with
OL,10,Fthe law".
OL,12,FThe party's economic spokesman told the
OL,13,FBBC that he does not expect that it
OL,14,Fwill have to return any of the money
OL,15,Ffrom Ben Delo and Christopher Harborne,
OL,16,Fwho are both British and have spent
OL,17,Ftime living overseas.
OL,19,FThe government is seeking to change the
OL,20,Flaw on donations to UK political
OL,21,Fparties from British expats, including
OL,22,Fa #100,000 cap backdated to 25 March.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
